WEBVTT

01:13.000 --> 01:16.999
[Meet Yourself]

01:17.000 --> 01:22.280
[Episode 03]

01:26.545 --> 01:28.015
In the evening,

01:28.505 --> 01:31.544
especially around the period
of the day from 9 p.m. to 11 p.m.,

01:31.545 --> 01:33.864
drinking a moderate amount of black tea

01:33.865 --> 01:35.544
can promote gastrointestinal motility.

01:35.545 --> 01:37.015
Nana.

01:37.265 --> 01:38.265
Mr. Ma.

01:39.815 --> 01:41.264
I brought you some night snacks.

01:41.265 --> 01:42.265
Thanks.

01:43.505 --> 01:44.904
Where's the new tenant?

01:44.905 --> 01:46.294
Tell her to come down to eat!

01:46.295 --> 01:47.655
She's not back yet.

01:48.705 --> 01:51.214
It's midnight now and it's dark outside.

01:51.215 --> 01:52.264
Where could she go?

01:52.265 --> 01:53.655
Maybe go for a walk on the beach?

01:56.545 --> 01:58.374
I see the light in Damai's room is still on.

01:58.375 --> 01:59.935
Tell her to come down and eat something.

02:00.455 --> 02:01.424
Don't ask her to come down.

02:01.425 --> 02:03.104
She is writing.

02:03.105 --> 02:05.944
It is her decision whether
she chooses to come or not.

02:05.945 --> 02:08.144
But it's our fault if
we don't even ask her.

02:08.145 --> 02:09.574
She doesn't like to be with too many people.

02:09.575 --> 02:10.824
You shouldn't always
put pressure on others.

02:10.825 --> 02:11.225
Alright?

02:11.226 --> 02:12.054
What now?

02:12.055 --> 02:14.265
How is it wrong for
me to be hospitable?

02:14.545 --> 02:16.144
She shouldn't always stay inside her room.

02:16.145 --> 02:17.014
She might get sick.

02:17.015 --> 02:18.825
She needs to go out for a walk.

02:19.265 --> 02:20.334
Damai, come down for some snacks!

02:20.335 --> 02:20.895
Stop yelling.

02:20.895 --> 02:21.895
My fault.

02:24.495 --> 02:25.705
What did Damai say?

02:26.015 --> 02:27.545
How do you know it's Damai?

02:31.705 --> 02:32.705
Here, Mr. Ma.

02:33.455 --> 02:35.335
No food after noon.

02:36.705 --> 02:37.855
It's really her.

02:38.425 --> 02:39.864
I'm good.

02:39.865 --> 02:40.865
Thank you.

02:41.575 --> 02:42.895
Good guess, Nana.

02:44.665 --> 02:45.294
Come here.

02:45.295 --> 02:46.424
Have a drink.

02:46.425 --> 02:47.384
No, I can't.

02:47.385 --> 02:48.384
I have to go to the warehouse with Xiaochun

02:48.385 --> 02:50.455
early tomorrow morning.

02:51.545 --> 02:52.265
You two.

02:52.266 --> 02:54.014
You don't eat after noon.

02:54.015 --> 02:55.494
You don't drink after noon.

02:55.495 --> 02:56.495
You guys are...

02:58.175 --> 02:59.385
Then I'll call a friend.

03:04.775 --> 03:06.015
Hi, everyone.

03:07.055 --> 03:09.104
Speak of the devil.

03:09.105 --> 03:09.825
Come on, Mr. Xie.

03:09.825 --> 03:10.615
Have a drink.

03:10.616 --> 03:11.984
You should have told me earlier.

03:11.985 --> 03:13.895
We've already had dinner at home.

03:15.145 --> 03:16.774
Who's this?

03:16.775 --> 03:19.145
I'm Xu Hongdou, the new tenant.

03:19.615 --> 03:20.614
Living upstairs.

03:20.615 --> 03:21.225
Nice to meet you.

03:21.226 --> 03:22.144
Let me introduce myself.

03:22.145 --> 03:23.334
I'm Hu Youyu.

03:23.335 --> 03:24.704
Just call me Hu.

03:24.705 --> 03:25.455
Nice to meet you, Hu.

03:25.456 --> 03:26.454
Nice to meet you, too.

03:26.455 --> 03:29.055
This is Ma Qiushan. We call him Mr. Ma.

03:31.145 --> 03:32.775
I saw him meditating
over there this afternoon.

03:33.545 --> 03:34.265
And this is...

03:34.265 --> 03:35.151
Nana.

03:35.175 --> 03:36.295
Hello, Nana.

03:37.055 --> 03:38.705
This beautiful lady had dinner with you at home?

03:39.425 --> 03:41.455
Aunt Baoping sent some beef over.

03:41.895 --> 03:43.384
How could you eat beef without me!

03:43.385 --> 03:45.425
If you guys come,
there won't be enough beef to eat.

03:46.055 --> 03:47.054
Well.

03:47.055 --> 03:47.705
You guys continue.

03:47.706 --> 03:49.054
I've got other things to do tonight.

03:49.055 --> 03:50.014
Good night.

03:50.015 --> 03:50.295
Okay.

03:50.296 --> 03:51.384
What do you have to do
in the middle of the night?

03:51.385 --> 03:52.425
Have a drink.

03:52.705 --> 03:53.544
I'll take a rain check.

03:53.545 --> 03:54.545
I should leave now.

03:57.495 --> 03:58.264
Well, Hongdou.

03:58.265 --> 03:59.774
The beer is for your arrival.

03:59.775 --> 04:00.494
Tonight is not okay.

04:00.495 --> 04:02.294
I haven't unpacked my luggage yet.

04:02.295 --> 04:03.424
I need to deal with it first.

04:03.425 --> 04:04.425
Let's do this tomorrow.

04:05.265 --> 04:06.294
Have an early rest.

04:06.295 --> 04:07.424
Call me if you need anything.

04:07.425 --> 04:08.894
I'm in this room.

04:08.895 --> 04:09.895
Okay.

04:09.985 --> 04:11.464
Hongdou.

04:11.465 --> 04:13.614
Shall we add each
other on WeChat?

04:13.615 --> 04:14.904
As you can see, my phone is broken.

04:14.905 --> 04:15.905
Let's wait until it's fixed.

04:17.295 --> 04:18.254
Good night.

04:18.255 --> 04:19.255
Good night.

04:19.585 --> 04:20.814
Then I... I live in that room.

04:20.815 --> 04:22.535
If you have any difficulties, just call me.

04:22.785 --> 04:23.785
Okay.

04:27.785 --> 04:28.785
Fine.

04:29.255 --> 04:30.455
She's also introverted.

04:31.785 --> 04:32.895
Even more introverted than Damai.

04:34.815 --> 04:36.224
I should go.

04:36.225 --> 04:37.374
Thanks for your night snacks.

04:37.375 --> 04:38.775
No, please stay a little longer.

04:39.225 --> 04:42.265
Wait... At least leave
me some barbecue.

04:42.615 --> 04:44.015
Hu,

04:44.865 --> 04:46.505
let it be.

04:48.025 --> 04:49.215
People should learn

04:50.135 --> 04:53.575
to get along with themselves.

04:55.255 --> 04:56.745
Let's meditate.

04:59.905 --> 05:01.385
I'll drink on my own.

05:33.275 --> 05:38.095
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

05:40.415 --> 05:45.655
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

05:48.175 --> 05:50.784
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

05:50.785 --> 05:52.095
It's ready to eat, right?

05:53.225 --> 05:54.535
Let's eat.

05:54.985 --> 05:55.985
Wait.

05:57.425 --> 06:00.415
I must introduce you
to the three dishes first,

06:01.375 --> 06:02.505
meeting between mother and son,

06:02.815 --> 06:04.575
the battle between Guan Yu and Qin Qiong,

06:05.255 --> 06:06.825
and the spicy kiss.

06:07.225 --> 06:07.735
Aren't these

06:07.736 --> 06:09.054
stir-fried soybean sprouts
with mung bean sprouts.

06:09.055 --> 06:11.224
Fried eggs with tomatoes,
and fried pig snouts with chili.

06:11.225 --> 06:12.614
Don't you find the dishes interesting?

06:12.615 --> 06:15.065
I just think this restaurant
serves food too slowly.

06:15.495 --> 06:16.374
I'm telling you

06:16.375 --> 06:17.814
I had to go back to the hotel
right after dinner.

06:17.815 --> 06:19.505
A tour group came today.

06:19.985 --> 06:21.705
I must be crazy.

06:21.935 --> 06:23.784
I'm so busy that I even have ulcers in my mouth

06:23.785 --> 06:24.694
but I still come to eat

06:24.695 --> 06:26.174
fried pig snouts with chili with you.

06:26.175 --> 06:27.054
I see. I see.

06:27.055 --> 06:28.984
It's because you love me.

06:28.985 --> 06:30.505
Can't afford to love you anymore.

06:30.815 --> 06:31.984
Waiter.

06:31.985 --> 06:33.584
A bowl of rice, please! Hurry up!

06:33.585 --> 06:33.985
Okay.

06:33.985 --> 06:34.694
Please wait a moment.

06:34.695 --> 06:37.215
When exactly will you be
free to go to Yunnan with me?

06:37.665 --> 06:39.095
I've been busy.

06:39.735 --> 06:40.745
We'll see.

06:41.495 --> 06:43.104
Actually, I used to wanna try

06:43.105 --> 06:45.374
one of their soups called poplar in the water.

06:45.375 --> 06:47.174
Poplar in the water?
(a kind of potherb growing in lakes)

06:47.175 --> 06:48.745
How did it get this name?

06:49.425 --> 06:51.694
It seems that the vegetable
is called poplar in the water.

06:51.695 --> 06:53.254
I've never tasted it either. I don't know.

06:53.255 --> 06:55.505
That's probably the taste of the vegetable soup.

07:01.495 --> 07:03.104
The fried pig snouts taste good.

07:03.105 --> 07:04.734
You should eat more.

07:04.735 --> 07:07.664
Please call it the spicy kiss.

07:07.665 --> 07:08.814
Fried pig snouts.

07:08.815 --> 07:09.495
Tour group.

07:09.495 --> 07:09.905
Fried pig snouts.

07:09.906 --> 07:10.814
Tour group. Tour group. Tour group.

07:10.815 --> 07:12.655
Fried pig snouts. Fried pig snouts.

07:14.985 --> 07:16.265
Yummy.

07:17.105 --> 07:18.335
Yummy.

08:37.225 --> 08:38.695
Hi, kitty.

08:47.495 --> 08:49.295
My name is Xu Hongdou, and you?

08:51.185 --> 08:52.414
I didn't sleep well yesterday.

08:52.415 --> 08:54.625
The window was open and
mosquitoes were coming in.

08:56.375 --> 08:57.865
You're so cute.

09:27.895 --> 09:28.895
Hello.

09:30.105 --> 09:31.064
I'm Xu Hongdou.

09:31.065 --> 09:32.415
I just came here yesterday.

09:33.415 --> 09:35.175
Hello, my name is Daimai.

09:35.535 --> 09:36.944
Damai.

09:36.945 --> 09:38.894
Hongdou and Damai

09:38.895 --> 09:40.145
are all food. (Hongdou refers to red bean
and Daimai refers to barley)

09:46.465 --> 09:47.935
You're up so early!

09:48.655 --> 09:50.345
I haven't slept yet.

09:50.735 --> 09:51.865
I stayed up all night.

09:52.225 --> 09:54.614
Well, I'm almost finished.

09:54.615 --> 09:55.534
It's alright.

09:55.535 --> 09:56.494
I don't cook.

09:56.495 --> 09:57.864
Just saying hello.

09:57.865 --> 09:58.895
Please go on.

10:03.225 --> 10:04.774
I've cooked too much.

10:04.775 --> 10:06.134
Would you like to have some?

10:06.135 --> 10:07.614
No, thanks.

10:07.615 --> 10:10.704
I'll... I'll make myself
a bowl of cereal later.

10:10.705 --> 10:11.705
Thanks.

10:11.775 --> 10:12.135
It's fine.

10:12.136 --> 10:13.745
I did cook too much.

10:16.465 --> 10:17.534
Alright then.

10:17.535 --> 10:18.535
Thank you.

10:29.655 --> 10:31.175
Who owns the cat?

10:36.775 --> 10:37.775
I don't know.

10:44.585 --> 10:46.345
There are mosquitoes in your room?

10:46.775 --> 10:48.464
Yesterday, I forgot to close the window
before going to bed.

10:48.465 --> 10:50.175
There are a lot of mosquitoes here.

10:51.465 --> 10:54.494
I have pesticides and
essential balm in my room.

10:54.495 --> 10:55.815
I'll bring you later.

10:56.065 --> 10:57.295
Sure. Thank you.

11:01.065 --> 11:03.015
I think you have a Hunan accent.

11:05.945 --> 11:07.374
I worked in a hotel before.

11:07.375 --> 11:10.614
I had a particularly good
relationship with a VIP customer

11:10.615 --> 11:11.775
who is also from Hunan Province.

11:12.065 --> 11:13.265
Your accent resembles his.

11:20.255 --> 11:21.695
Where is the hotel?

11:23.065 --> 11:25.134
A five-star hotel in Beijing.

11:25.135 --> 11:27.265
So you're from Beijing?

11:27.895 --> 11:28.895
No.

11:29.655 --> 11:32.104
I studied in Beijing.

11:32.105 --> 11:34.745
Then... Then I
found a job there.

11:35.615 --> 11:37.345
I spent more than ten years in Beijing.

11:38.015 --> 11:39.345
I am from Shandong Province.

11:44.865 --> 11:46.895
So what are you
doing here this time?

11:48.135 --> 11:49.224
I quit my job.

11:49.225 --> 11:52.015
I just wanna come here to relax and unwind.

11:53.535 --> 11:54.865
How?

12:01.255 --> 12:02.895
Find somewhere else to scroll on your phone?

12:03.135 --> 12:04.415
Not exactly.

12:04.735 --> 12:06.295
The scenery here is gorgeous.

12:07.015 --> 12:08.935
I can try to stay away from the phone.

12:10.495 --> 12:12.134
So what are you doing today?

12:12.135 --> 12:13.464
Fix my phone.

12:13.465 --> 12:14.935
My phone doesn't work.

12:16.305 --> 12:18.465
Isn't that just the right time
to get away from the phone?

12:19.185 --> 12:20.104
As long as the phone is within your reach

12:20.105 --> 12:21.224
you will always want to use it.

12:21.225 --> 12:23.745
Now that it's not working,
you won't want to use it anymore.

12:25.895 --> 12:26.895
Well.

12:31.135 --> 12:31.984
I cooked the breakfast.

12:31.985 --> 12:33.464
Could you wash the dishes?

12:33.465 --> 12:34.654
Of course.

12:34.655 --> 12:35.864
Leave them to me.

12:35.865 --> 12:36.865
Thanks.

12:41.895 --> 12:43.265
Then I'm off.

14:30.825 --> 14:32.774
Breakfast!

14:32.775 --> 14:33.375
Hurry up!

14:33.376 --> 14:35.014
I'm about to be late for work.

14:35.015 --> 14:35.535
Got it.

14:35.535 --> 14:36.254
Alright, alright.

14:36.255 --> 14:38.584
Granny can't wait.

14:38.585 --> 14:40.385
She's gonna get angry.

14:41.135 --> 14:42.345
Let's have breakfast.

14:43.985 --> 14:45.534
Our young master hasn't come down yet.

14:45.535 --> 14:46.464
What does he want?

14:46.465 --> 14:47.774
Bring the food to his bed?

14:47.775 --> 14:49.824
Hulu, tell your uncle to have breakfast.

14:49.825 --> 14:50.825
Go.

14:51.585 --> 14:53.064
Don't be angry with him.

14:53.065 --> 14:55.064
His heart has long
since flown away.

14:55.065 --> 14:56.935
He won't listen to what we say anymore.

14:57.535 --> 14:58.895
No, he won't.

14:59.225 --> 15:00.944
No matter what I tell him,

15:00.945 --> 15:02.584
it goes in one ear and out the other.

15:02.585 --> 15:04.494
His brain is not working.

15:04.495 --> 15:06.985
If I had been angry with him,
I would have died already.

15:07.775 --> 15:08.584
Don't let anger kill you.

15:08.585 --> 15:10.374
Killing me is enough.

15:10.375 --> 15:11.935
Your father is down there
in hell waiting for me anyway.

15:12.985 --> 15:14.775
Li Baoping.

15:15.225 --> 15:17.534
No matter who is killed by anger,
it won't be you.

15:17.535 --> 15:18.494
You have suffered a lot in your life.

15:18.495 --> 15:20.064
Now it's finally the time
to enjoy your later life.

15:20.065 --> 15:21.815
If someone tries to kill you with anger,
I'm telling you

15:22.135 --> 15:23.344
the king of hell will not agree,

15:23.345 --> 15:24.895
and the little ghosts
dare not to take your soul.

15:26.945 --> 15:28.734
Let my dad wait down in hell.

15:28.735 --> 15:30.385
Let him wait a few more decades.

15:33.255 --> 15:34.734
Granny, uncle won't get up.

15:34.735 --> 15:37.175
Uncle Yuan is also sleeping in his room.

15:37.825 --> 15:38.985
Okay, come over for breakfast.

15:40.345 --> 15:42.014
When did Yuan come?

15:42.015 --> 15:43.145
I don't know.

15:44.345 --> 15:45.345
I'll go upstairs and have a look!

16:28.225 --> 16:29.625
Are you the new tenant?

16:31.305 --> 16:31.824
Yes.

16:31.825 --> 16:32.375
Hello.

16:32.376 --> 16:34.414
Hello. Welcome.

16:34.415 --> 16:35.774
Mr. Ma.

16:35.775 --> 16:36.824
No need to say hello to him.

16:36.825 --> 16:38.655
He can't hear you during the day.

16:39.775 --> 16:40.865
Newcomer.

16:41.825 --> 16:44.505
There are a few
things I need to tell you.

16:45.065 --> 16:48.014
I am responsible for
the cleaning of this yard.

16:48.015 --> 16:51.534
Don't throw your garbage
around or leave it at the door.

16:51.535 --> 16:53.344
All of your garbage should
be thrown into the garbage bin

16:53.345 --> 16:54.105
next to the laundry room.

16:54.106 --> 16:55.184
Can you see it?

16:55.185 --> 16:56.224
Your garbage goes there.

16:56.225 --> 16:59.134
And you should clean
up your room yourself.

16:59.135 --> 17:00.264
I won't be responsible for it.

17:00.265 --> 17:00.545
Okay.

17:00.545 --> 17:01.214
Do you hear me?

17:01.215 --> 17:01.824
Yes.

17:01.825 --> 17:02.825
I got it.

17:04.025 --> 17:05.735
You are very good-looking.

17:06.065 --> 17:08.065
Just like my girl Xi.

17:08.655 --> 17:10.415
Why did you come here?

17:10.895 --> 17:12.784
I'm here to give myself a break.

17:12.785 --> 17:14.025
The air here is fresh.

17:14.375 --> 17:15.784
What about your job?

17:15.785 --> 17:16.825
I quit.

17:18.175 --> 17:20.134
Only townspeople like
you have the courage

17:20.135 --> 17:22.175
to quit your job as you please.

17:22.785 --> 17:24.625
But I'm not working for others.

17:25.655 --> 17:28.934
One third of the rooms
in this yard belong to me.

17:28.935 --> 17:30.305
These are my properties.

17:30.545 --> 17:32.024
Then you're Mrs. Landlady.

17:32.025 --> 17:34.655
No wonder you speak in such a decent manner.

17:36.935 --> 17:38.545
Mrs. Landlady.

17:40.105 --> 17:41.585
I've never been called like this.

17:42.375 --> 17:45.024
But it sounds fancy. Really fancy.

17:45.025 --> 17:47.784
You city girls
are sweet-talkers.

17:47.785 --> 17:49.385
A decent manner?

17:49.895 --> 17:52.024
I am merely an old
lady living in the village.

17:52.025 --> 17:53.174
Just feel at ease.

17:53.175 --> 17:54.544
Call me Aunt Gui from now on.

17:54.545 --> 17:56.105
Okay, Aunt Gui.

17:58.135 --> 17:59.374
Where is your hometown?

17:59.375 --> 18:01.305
I'm from Shandong Province.

18:01.785 --> 18:02.935
Shandong Province.

18:03.695 --> 18:05.174
Qingdao City?

18:05.175 --> 18:07.304
No. It's a small third-tier city.

18:07.305 --> 18:08.585
But it's not far away from Qingdao.

18:09.265 --> 18:11.145
There is a special connection between us.

18:11.415 --> 18:14.385
My son and daughter are both in Qingdao.

18:14.615 --> 18:16.105
They didn't go there to work.

18:16.345 --> 18:19.064
Both of them went
to the university there,

18:19.065 --> 18:20.744
and they stayed there after graduation.

18:20.745 --> 18:22.785
Now they are
married and have kids.

18:23.215 --> 18:24.614
That's awesome!

18:24.615 --> 18:26.345
I don't think so.

18:27.175 --> 18:28.695
My son Yang

18:28.975 --> 18:31.785
bought a big apartment in Qingdao.

18:32.135 --> 18:33.504
What's the point of buying such a big apartment?

18:33.505 --> 18:34.824
He still has to pay the mortgage.

18:34.825 --> 18:35.935
Yeah.

18:37.935 --> 18:41.214
Aunt Gui,
do you know how to get to Xiaochun's cafe?

18:41.215 --> 18:42.304
Of course.

18:42.305 --> 18:43.305
Pretty close.

18:43.655 --> 18:45.454
You go out of the door and turn left.

18:45.455 --> 18:47.584
Walk to the end and you'll see another alley.

18:47.585 --> 18:48.345
Then turn left.

18:48.346 --> 18:50.064
Then walk to the end of the road and turn right.

18:50.065 --> 18:51.934
Keep walking and you'll arrive
at the entrance of the town.

18:51.935 --> 18:52.694
You can ask others on the way.

18:52.695 --> 18:53.265
Okay.

18:53.265 --> 18:54.305
But it's very close.

18:56.135 --> 18:57.145
Thanks.

19:06.695 --> 19:08.695
He is deaf during the day.

19:09.745 --> 19:10.935
I'd better let you go.

19:11.175 --> 19:11.894
Sure.

19:11.895 --> 19:13.025
I should get going.

19:34.615 --> 19:37.174
♫ Stars in the sky ♫

19:37.175 --> 19:39.815
♫ I pick some mushrooms. ♫

19:40.215 --> 19:42.774
♫ Mushrooms can fill the basket. ♫

19:42.775 --> 19:45.335
♫ I take out a pen. ♫

19:45.615 --> 19:48.175
♫ The pen leaks ink. ♫

19:48.415 --> 19:51.374
♫ What can I do? ♫

19:51.375 --> 19:52.414
Come here Yao.

19:52.415 --> 19:53.545
Have an apple.

19:53.785 --> 19:54.785
Thank you.

19:55.695 --> 19:56.265
This one is for you.

19:56.266 --> 19:57.264
Thank you.

19:57.265 --> 19:58.345
No problem.

19:59.935 --> 20:02.375
♫ Mung beans are delicious. ♫

20:02.895 --> 20:05.174
♫ Gingers are tender. ♫

20:05.175 --> 20:07.934
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent. ♫

20:07.935 --> 20:10.815
♫ They pile up like a tower, ♫

20:11.095 --> 20:13.655
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

20:13.895 --> 20:16.534
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

20:16.535 --> 20:19.104
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

20:19.105 --> 20:20.544
Would you like to braid your hair
with colored ribbon?

20:20.545 --> 20:21.304
No, thanks.

20:21.305 --> 20:23.374
Have a try. It will look beautiful.

20:23.375 --> 20:24.344
Have a try.

20:24.345 --> 20:25.544
No, thanks.

20:25.545 --> 20:26.735
Xu Hongdou.

20:33.305 --> 20:34.625
Grandma Xie.

20:35.415 --> 20:37.744
Call me granny.

20:37.745 --> 20:38.824
Have you eaten?

20:38.825 --> 20:39.935
Yes.

20:40.545 --> 20:41.864
Granny, is this your booth?

20:41.865 --> 20:42.694
Yes.

20:42.695 --> 20:44.585
These are all my handicrafts.

20:45.305 --> 20:46.744
Which one do you like?

20:46.745 --> 20:47.694
I'll give it to you.

20:47.695 --> 20:48.345
No. Thank you so much.

20:48.346 --> 20:49.454
Take it.

20:49.455 --> 20:50.504
It's okay.

20:50.505 --> 20:51.825
Where are you going?

20:52.505 --> 20:54.064
I want to go to Xiaochun's cafe.

20:54.065 --> 20:55.065
How should I get there?

20:55.305 --> 20:56.655
You're going in the opposite direction!

20:57.135 --> 20:58.865
You have to go east
at that intersection in front.

21:01.545 --> 21:02.694
Let me take you there.

21:02.695 --> 21:03.974
No, thanks. I can go by myself.

21:03.975 --> 21:05.694
It's nothing,
I'm just about to go there as well.

21:05.695 --> 21:07.454
I'm going to the cafe, granny.

21:07.455 --> 21:08.455
Okay.

21:08.935 --> 21:10.024
See you, granny.

21:10.025 --> 21:11.025
Hongdou.

21:11.615 --> 21:13.504
An orange for you.

21:13.505 --> 21:14.505
Thank you. granny.

21:14.825 --> 21:15.544
See you.

21:15.545 --> 21:16.264
See you.

21:16.265 --> 21:17.735
I'll come to pick you up in the evening.

21:19.105 --> 21:20.174
This way.

21:20.175 --> 21:21.255
I went in the opposite direction.

21:25.615 --> 21:27.825
I feel like we've come full circle.

21:28.505 --> 21:31.255
You are here for relaxation,
so I wanna show you around.

21:34.455 --> 21:36.455
Aren't you going to fix your phone today?

21:38.305 --> 21:39.735
It's okay to fix it tomorrow.

21:41.935 --> 21:43.385
Are you hiding from your creditors?

21:45.135 --> 21:46.785
You know how to start a conversation.

21:47.935 --> 21:49.145
That's what everyone says.

21:50.865 --> 21:52.455
After all, as you can see,

21:52.785 --> 21:55.255
I am the most handsome man
who is known as Pony Prince

21:57.455 --> 21:58.935
in our village.

22:00.745 --> 22:01.504
However,

22:01.505 --> 22:03.455
I've never regarded my good looks
as my moneymaker.

22:03.695 --> 22:05.495
I have been studying online every day.

22:06.375 --> 22:08.504
After all, I forgot the solution

22:08.505 --> 22:09.784
to the linear equation in one variable

22:09.785 --> 22:10.785
after graduating from junior high school.

22:14.065 --> 22:15.345
A friendly reminder.

22:15.655 --> 22:17.824
You can start to laugh at me

22:17.825 --> 22:19.264
when I said I'm the most handsome man.

22:19.265 --> 22:20.614
I won't be embarrassed.

22:20.615 --> 22:22.215
It's okay if you don't talk.

22:23.345 --> 22:24.504
Slow down.

22:24.505 --> 22:25.744
It looks like your feet
are powered by an engine.

22:25.745 --> 22:27.385
I walk slowly enough.

22:28.585 --> 22:29.865
The scenery is so beautiful.

22:30.585 --> 22:31.695
Take a look at Erhai Lake.

22:45.975 --> 22:47.305
Isn't Erhai Lake beautiful?

22:51.895 --> 22:54.105
When I was a child,

22:54.655 --> 22:56.415
my grandpa had a fishing boat

22:56.785 --> 22:57.785
which was especially small.

22:58.895 --> 23:01.544
Every time I stood on it,
the boat wobbled,

23:01.545 --> 23:02.695
which made me extremely scared.

23:03.865 --> 23:05.654
But when my grandpa
stood on it and started fishing,

23:05.655 --> 23:06.735
it was particularly stable.

23:08.175 --> 23:09.784
Every time grandpa went fishing on the lake

23:09.785 --> 23:11.584
with the fish hawk,

23:11.585 --> 23:13.585
I sat by the Erhai Lake and waited for him.

23:15.175 --> 23:16.695
Have you ever seen a fish hawk?

23:18.025 --> 23:19.255
It's a kind of

23:19.615 --> 23:21.614
black bird with a wide beak

23:21.615 --> 23:22.825
that is particularly good at catching fish.

23:23.135 --> 23:25.415
But now the bird
can be rarely seen.

23:27.545 --> 23:29.105
Your grandfather was a fisherman.

23:30.935 --> 23:33.215
Just live off the land.

23:34.265 --> 23:37.345
In the past,
Erhai Lake was super clear and full of fish.

23:37.785 --> 23:38.974
Later,

23:38.975 --> 23:40.614
in order to protect the ecological
environment of the Erhai Lake,

23:40.615 --> 23:41.974
the government banned fishing
throughout the year,

23:41.975 --> 23:43.625
so no fishing boats could be seen now.

23:45.105 --> 23:47.065
But every time I stand beside Erhai Lake,

23:47.305 --> 23:48.694
I always feel that

23:48.695 --> 23:50.625
my grandfather is still fishing out there.

24:00.375 --> 24:02.065
Time flies!

24:04.215 --> 24:05.215
Yeah.

24:05.745 --> 24:07.975
When I was a child,
I felt that the days passed very slowly.

24:08.655 --> 24:11.825
But now, time goes by too fast.

24:18.935 --> 24:23.775
♫ The sun will rise and fall. ♫

24:26.215 --> 24:28.215
Your granny is affable.

24:29.745 --> 24:30.745
She likes you.

24:31.345 --> 24:32.345
Really?

24:34.345 --> 24:35.545
Let me ask you a question.

24:35.825 --> 24:37.825
What is a linear equation in one variable?

24:42.135 --> 24:46.105
If an equation is of the first
degree in only one variable,

24:46.975 --> 24:50.214
and always has a straight line as a graph,

24:50.215 --> 24:53.344
then this equation is a linear
equation in one variable.

24:53.345 --> 24:54.825
Did you really forget it?

24:55.215 --> 24:57.175
It is weird that you remember so clearly,
isn't it?

25:07.105 --> 25:08.105
Nana.

25:08.305 --> 25:09.305
Mr. Xie.

25:11.105 --> 25:12.214
Xu Hongdou.

25:12.215 --> 25:12.695
Nana.

25:12.696 --> 25:14.545
Hulu. Guobao.

25:15.345 --> 25:17.305
Uncle Yao.

25:18.825 --> 25:19.615
Did you clean up your room?

25:19.615 --> 25:20.135
We wanna fly a plane!

25:20.136 --> 25:21.214
Fly a plane!

25:21.215 --> 25:21.655
Let's go.

25:21.655 --> 25:22.135
We can fly!

25:22.136 --> 25:23.374
What do you want to drink?

25:23.375 --> 25:24.654
Xiaochun has said

25:24.655 --> 25:26.264
that your drink is on the house
for the first time.

25:26.265 --> 25:26.785
No, thanks.

25:26.786 --> 25:28.545
Business is business.

25:32.505 --> 25:34.584
We do long-term business.

25:34.585 --> 25:35.934
Gift blinds eyes.

25:35.935 --> 25:38.504
Now you gotta come more often
to support our business in the future.

25:38.505 --> 25:39.614
Sure.

25:39.615 --> 25:40.744
I haven't had lunch yet.

25:40.745 --> 25:41.975
Take a look at the menu.

25:44.895 --> 25:46.064
Where is Xiaochun?

25:46.065 --> 25:47.255
She went to pick up someone at the junction.

25:49.785 --> 25:52.864
I recommend the porcini pancake.

25:52.865 --> 25:53.265
Okay.

25:53.266 --> 25:54.134
Nana.

25:54.135 --> 25:55.134
Nana.

25:55.135 --> 25:56.344
Is the coffee ready?

25:56.345 --> 25:56.825
Yes.

25:56.825 --> 25:57.825
Mr. Xie.

26:01.065 --> 26:02.655
You are Hongdou, aren't you?

26:03.375 --> 26:05.495
You look beautiful in your outfit.

26:06.695 --> 26:08.065
I can tell you're a tourist at first sight.

26:09.265 --> 26:12.104
Well,
I'm going downtown to give a singing performance.

26:12.105 --> 26:13.064
How about joining me?

26:13.065 --> 26:15.695
I have plans for today.

26:16.135 --> 26:17.864
By the way,
I haven't added you on WeChat yet.

26:17.865 --> 26:18.305
Can I have your WeChat?

26:18.305 --> 26:19.305
Let me scan your QR code.

26:19.895 --> 26:20.895
See.

26:21.135 --> 26:22.454
My phone is broken.

26:22.455 --> 26:23.585
Oh, it is.

26:24.215 --> 26:25.215
Then.

26:25.345 --> 26:26.135
How about this?

26:26.136 --> 26:28.544
You can go downtown with me,
so you can

26:28.545 --> 26:29.544
have your phone repaired.

26:29.545 --> 26:30.825
Then I can add you on WeChat.

26:31.065 --> 26:32.744
I wanna have a rest today.

26:32.745 --> 26:33.825
Have a rest?

26:34.215 --> 26:35.255
No problem. You'll stay here,

26:35.895 --> 26:36.864
and I'll go singing.

26:36.865 --> 26:38.454
Let's have a drink tonight. My treat.

26:38.455 --> 26:38.824
Bye.

26:38.825 --> 26:39.504
Goodbye.

26:39.505 --> 26:39.824
Bye.

26:39.825 --> 26:40.825
Bye-bye.

26:43.265 --> 26:45.545
Hu is always warm to others.

26:45.825 --> 26:47.735
Especially to girls.

26:54.935 --> 26:55.935
Xiaochun.

26:57.415 --> 26:58.455
I'm at the cafe.

27:03.545 --> 27:08.654
Ms. Li. Let me introduce to you my brother,
Xie Zhiyao.

27:08.655 --> 27:10.374
Brother, this is Ms. Li.

27:10.375 --> 27:12.695
A Chinese teacher in elementary school, right?

27:12.935 --> 27:13.864
It's the first time that you've met each other.

27:13.865 --> 27:14.865
How about

27:15.065 --> 27:16.255
shaking hands first?

27:17.615 --> 27:18.454
Nice to meet you.

27:18.455 --> 27:19.625
Nice to meet you, too.

27:26.505 --> 27:28.215
This is the porcini pancake.

27:29.265 --> 27:30.305
Thank you.

27:30.545 --> 27:31.655
You're welcome.

27:39.215 --> 27:41.134
This is our brochure

27:41.135 --> 27:42.374
which introduces all the scenic spots
and interesting places

27:42.375 --> 27:43.654
in the village and near the town.

27:43.655 --> 27:45.025
You can have a look.

27:46.655 --> 27:47.694
This is a hand-drawn map.

27:47.695 --> 27:49.864
You can go for a walk
around after lunch.

27:49.865 --> 27:51.024
Can I take it with me?

27:51.025 --> 27:52.025
Yes.

27:53.065 --> 27:58.504
It is made from persimmons,
walnuts, and raisins.

27:58.505 --> 27:59.065
It's super nutritious.

27:59.066 --> 28:00.024
You can have a try later.

28:00.025 --> 28:01.134
Okay.

28:01.135 --> 28:02.935
What an awkward blind date.

28:03.265 --> 28:04.784
Both of their last names are Xie.

28:04.785 --> 28:06.304
They are cousins?

28:06.305 --> 28:07.694
Not exactly.

28:07.695 --> 28:10.784
Mr. Xie is 32 years old.

28:10.785 --> 28:13.345
Xiaochun is about 28 years old.

28:13.585 --> 28:15.585
They are related to each other
by blood in some ways.

28:16.305 --> 28:19.614
It can be said they are
relatives from the same village?

28:19.615 --> 28:21.545
But they get along well wth each other.

28:22.785 --> 28:24.065
Thirty-two.

28:25.375 --> 28:26.414
This is Autumn Dew tea.

28:26.415 --> 28:27.544
That is Indigo Naturalis tea.

28:27.545 --> 28:29.064
Oh, you're right.

28:29.065 --> 28:29.695
Not proficient in your business.

28:29.696 --> 28:31.214
All the members
of Mr. Xie's family

28:31.215 --> 28:33.784
are not as anxious as Xiaochun.

28:33.785 --> 28:34.744
She would like to find him
a girlfriend every day

28:34.745 --> 28:36.735
if she could.

28:37.505 --> 28:39.025
Nana.

28:39.615 --> 28:40.695
Yes?

28:41.135 --> 28:43.865
Nana I want to eat pancakes.

28:44.305 --> 28:46.134
Didn't you just have lunch?

28:46.135 --> 28:47.694
Why do you want pancakes now?

28:47.695 --> 28:49.264
Have you finished your spelling exercise?

28:49.265 --> 28:51.865
But I want pancakes.

28:54.175 --> 28:55.385
Here. Take it.

29:00.215 --> 29:02.064
Say thank you to Hongdou.

29:02.065 --> 29:03.454
Thank you, Hongdou.

29:03.455 --> 29:04.585
Don't mention it.

29:14.655 --> 29:16.215
Thank you, Miss.

29:23.615 --> 29:25.105
Whose kids are they?

29:25.615 --> 29:27.864
Hulu is Xiaochun's kid.

29:27.865 --> 29:29.024
Guobao is the child of Yang Guanjun

29:29.025 --> 29:31.025
who sells barbecue at night at the junction.

29:31.545 --> 29:33.344
Xiaochun's daughter?

29:33.345 --> 29:34.865
Did she get married?

29:36.375 --> 29:38.134
She got divorced.

29:38.135 --> 29:39.134
Her ex-husband is in Kunming.

29:39.135 --> 29:40.504
The custody of the child goes to her.

29:40.505 --> 29:41.505
Waiter.

29:41.895 --> 29:42.864
Coming.

29:42.865 --> 29:44.065
Enjoy your meal.

29:45.065 --> 29:46.864
Usually,
apart from teaching at school,

29:46.865 --> 29:49.174
I also like hiking and camping.

29:49.175 --> 29:50.454
By the way,
I also organized a camping squad

29:50.455 --> 29:52.344
in our elementary school.

29:52.345 --> 29:54.025
Camping squad!

29:57.745 --> 29:58.544
And what?

29:58.545 --> 30:00.264
Camping squad!

30:00.265 --> 30:02.105
It's good. Sounds interesting.

30:02.455 --> 30:05.304
I'm telling you that my
brother is also a fan of

30:05.305 --> 30:06.374
such outdoor activities.

30:06.375 --> 30:08.625
You can tell from his
good figure immediately.

30:09.105 --> 30:12.654
And what's more,
My brother also likes to ride horses.

30:12.655 --> 30:14.744
He has a horse with a
particularly lovely name,

30:14.745 --> 30:16.304
called Lil Cute.

30:16.305 --> 30:17.784
Keep your voice down!

30:17.785 --> 30:19.175
Do not affect the customers.

30:20.175 --> 30:21.495
I see. I see.

30:24.745 --> 30:25.935
It tastes sweet.

30:27.135 --> 30:28.544
But not too sweet, is it?

30:28.545 --> 30:29.265
Yeah.

30:29.266 --> 30:30.504
It's refreshing.

30:30.505 --> 30:31.374
Let me get you some more tea.

30:31.375 --> 30:32.024
Sure.

30:32.025 --> 30:32.825
Here you are.

30:32.826 --> 30:34.065
Thank you, Xiaochun.

30:36.745 --> 30:38.025
Thanks.

30:39.265 --> 30:40.694
Make yourself at home here.

30:40.695 --> 30:41.454
Don't be a stranger.

30:41.455 --> 30:42.785
Okay.

30:46.455 --> 30:50.975
♫ The sun will rise and fall. ♫

30:57.255 --> 31:02.175
♫ It's just another day. ♫

31:23.585 --> 31:25.545
Feel free to look around
and see what you need.

31:27.175 --> 31:29.215
Did you make all
the crafts here?

31:29.745 --> 31:32.064
No. My master and
other masters in the village

31:32.065 --> 31:33.504
put them here
for selling after they carved them.

31:33.505 --> 31:34.265
I've just learned for a few years.

31:34.266 --> 31:35.585
I can't make such masterpieces.

31:44.785 --> 31:46.025
What's that?

31:47.025 --> 31:48.695
I carved it for fun.

31:51.265 --> 31:52.545
Interesting.

31:54.135 --> 31:55.255
Really?

31:56.135 --> 31:58.545
This woman seems to be furious.

31:58.825 --> 32:00.345
But she looks funny.

32:00.615 --> 32:01.735
Who is she?

32:02.265 --> 32:03.265
My sister.

32:04.585 --> 32:05.585
Your sister?

32:07.105 --> 32:08.655
I thought she is my sister.

32:11.655 --> 32:13.305
You're from the cafe next door?

32:13.975 --> 32:15.975
I see the two yards are next to each other.

32:16.345 --> 32:18.145
My sister is running that cafe.

32:18.785 --> 32:20.174
Your sister is Xie Xiaochun?

32:20.175 --> 32:21.504
Do you know my sister?

32:21.505 --> 32:22.414
I rented a room here.

32:22.415 --> 32:23.495
I just arrived yesterday.

32:24.695 --> 32:26.545
You are the new tenant.

32:26.825 --> 32:28.215
I'm Xie Xiaoxia.

32:28.545 --> 32:29.545
I'm Xu Hongdou.

32:33.135 --> 32:34.135
Xu Hongdou.

32:36.455 --> 32:38.385
Here. Just for fun.

32:40.615 --> 32:41.374
Thank you.

32:41.375 --> 32:42.304
It's nothing.

32:42.305 --> 32:43.345
Come when you're available.

32:43.895 --> 32:44.895
Bye-bye.

34:07.175 --> 34:11.935
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

34:14.135 --> 34:19.495
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

34:21.415 --> 34:28.454
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

34:28.455 --> 34:33.695
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

34:36.895 --> 34:37.665
You've known the way.

34:37.666 --> 34:38.945
You should come again.

34:41.225 --> 34:42.201
Here.

34:42.225 --> 34:43.054
Thank you, Xiaochun.

34:43.055 --> 34:44.344
I am so glad to meet you!

34:44.345 --> 34:45.224
I'll definitely come again.

34:45.225 --> 34:47.054
This is our new tea.

34:47.055 --> 34:48.545
You must try.

34:48.785 --> 34:49.744
Thank you for the gift.

34:49.745 --> 34:50.744
Bye-bye.

34:50.745 --> 34:51.454
You're welcome.

34:51.455 --> 34:52.494
Come again when you have time.

34:52.495 --> 34:53.054
Safe trip home.

34:53.055 --> 34:54.055
Okay.

34:55.265 --> 34:56.655
Come again.

34:56.975 --> 34:57.975
Bye-bye.

35:01.705 --> 35:03.105
Are you keen on Ms. Li?

35:03.705 --> 35:05.494
Yes.

35:05.495 --> 35:07.184
I think Mrs. Li is really nice.

35:07.185 --> 35:08.585
How about you marry her?

35:08.935 --> 35:11.864
You talk as if she'll marry
me if I propose to her.

35:11.865 --> 35:13.344
She's got no interest in me.

35:13.345 --> 35:14.344
How?

35:14.345 --> 35:14.825
If she's not interested in you,

35:14.826 --> 35:16.974
why did she want to add you on WeChat?

35:16.975 --> 35:19.534
I'm telling you now that
you have her WeChat,

35:19.535 --> 35:21.145
you should talk to her more often.

35:21.375 --> 35:23.704
Just make friends with her first.

35:23.705 --> 35:25.855
Ms. Li is really nice.

35:26.185 --> 35:27.775
Yes, she is.

35:28.225 --> 35:29.784
What about Xiaxia...

35:29.785 --> 35:31.945
Don't change the subject!

35:32.625 --> 35:33.894
I got it.

35:33.895 --> 35:35.184
I had her WeChat.

35:35.185 --> 35:36.624
She's a nice woman.

35:36.625 --> 35:38.414
We can be friends first.

35:38.415 --> 35:39.414
Don't be offhand with me.

35:39.415 --> 35:40.744
Be proactive.

35:40.745 --> 35:42.014
Okay.

35:42.015 --> 35:43.224
So what about Xiaxia?

35:43.225 --> 35:44.985
Why is he suddenly going to Shanghai?

35:45.865 --> 35:47.295
Just as my mom has told you,

35:48.375 --> 35:51.545
he recently met a
friend from Shanghai.

35:51.865 --> 35:52.864
Since he was invited,

35:52.865 --> 35:54.335
he wanted to go to Shanghai
and meet with this friend.

35:56.055 --> 35:57.264
A friend from Shanghai.

35:57.265 --> 35:58.454
He or she?

35:58.455 --> 35:59.414
He said it's a he.

35:59.415 --> 36:01.145
They knew each other while playing games.

36:01.575 --> 36:03.304
But I don't think so.

36:03.305 --> 36:05.374
Recently, when he took shower,

36:05.375 --> 36:07.374
he would bring his phone
into the bathroom with him.

36:07.375 --> 36:08.625
I guess

36:09.015 --> 36:10.465
it's very likely that
he has fallen in love with someone online.

36:12.305 --> 36:15.625
It's time for Xiaxia
to date someone now.

36:16.345 --> 36:17.864
But my mom didn't think so.

36:17.865 --> 36:21.735
She said Xiaxia just wanna
find a job in Shanghai.

36:23.975 --> 36:25.775
If that is the case,

36:26.055 --> 36:28.695
he's an adult now,
and you can't stop him anymore.

36:29.305 --> 36:31.934
If he wants to chill out in Shanghai,
just let him go.

36:31.935 --> 36:34.625
If he is so determined
to find a job there,

36:35.015 --> 36:36.175
just let him do it.

36:38.265 --> 36:39.465
But

36:40.185 --> 36:42.335
his master is not in a
good mood recently.

36:42.785 --> 36:45.624
A few years ago,
his son had to go into machine carving,

36:45.625 --> 36:46.624
which made him so angry that
he developed high blood pressure,

36:46.625 --> 36:47.905
and was hospitalized.

36:48.865 --> 36:50.094
Later, he was given the title of

36:50.095 --> 36:52.145
municipal inheritor
of intangible cultural heritage.

36:52.375 --> 36:53.574
And he felt the need to carry forward
this cultural heritage,

36:53.575 --> 36:55.215
He took on a dozen apprentices.

36:55.495 --> 36:59.175
However,
his apprentices have left one by one.

36:59.535 --> 37:00.494
Xiaxia is the one who has been learning with him

37:00.495 --> 37:02.344
for the longest time.

37:02.345 --> 37:03.744
Besides, they both came from the same village,

37:03.745 --> 37:05.094
so they're related.

37:05.095 --> 37:07.105
He's really devoted to Xiaxia.

37:07.745 --> 37:09.585
If Xiaxia leaves him like this,

37:10.055 --> 37:11.585
I'm afraid he can't stand it.

37:11.865 --> 37:13.655
He can't stand it, but he has to.

37:14.185 --> 37:15.815
My granny once said

37:16.305 --> 37:17.735
the times have changed.

37:18.185 --> 37:19.574
Deeply buried gold cannot shine.

37:19.575 --> 37:21.784
The platform for traditional handicrafts
becomes smaller and smaller.

37:21.785 --> 37:22.864
No one knows them even if they are valuable.

37:22.865 --> 37:24.145
There is no market for them.

37:24.865 --> 37:26.255
His apprentices have learned the craft,

37:26.575 --> 37:28.224
but they can not make money from it.

37:28.225 --> 37:29.335
What else can they do except for leaving.

37:30.055 --> 37:31.055
Right.

37:31.665 --> 37:33.695
If you want to help him promote his handicrafts,

37:34.095 --> 37:34.575
he won't accept it

37:34.576 --> 37:36.335
because he thinks advertisements are deceptive.

37:39.265 --> 37:40.264
How about this?

37:40.265 --> 37:41.094
I'll let Xiaxia come over for dinner tonight

37:41.095 --> 37:42.735
so that he can talk to him about it.

37:44.665 --> 37:46.094
Thank you, brother.

37:46.095 --> 37:47.255
Anytime.

37:58.745 --> 37:59.974
The color distribution is not uniform.

37:59.975 --> 38:01.255
I'll show you.

38:03.895 --> 38:04.664
Look carefully.

38:04.665 --> 38:05.344
Okay.

38:05.345 --> 38:06.304
Take as many pictures as you can.

38:06.305 --> 38:06.825
Good.

38:06.826 --> 38:08.255
These can be used for advertisement.

38:12.415 --> 38:13.784
You should start knitting there.

38:13.785 --> 38:15.985
Great. Now the color is distributed uniformly.

38:18.145 --> 38:19.855
You can put it down a little.

38:22.535 --> 38:23.894
Mom. Mom.

38:23.895 --> 38:25.494
I caught a butterfly.

38:25.495 --> 38:26.704
Yao.

38:26.705 --> 38:28.624
Butterflies are beneficial
insects that can spread pollen

38:28.625 --> 38:30.184
to help crops grow.

38:30.185 --> 38:31.335
Set it free.

38:33.455 --> 38:34.414
Yao.

38:34.415 --> 38:35.224
Come here.

38:35.225 --> 38:37.144
Let me make you a
hat with a lotus on it.

38:37.145 --> 38:38.304
I don't like the lotus.

38:38.305 --> 38:39.664
It's for girls.

38:39.665 --> 38:41.105
Then what do you like?

38:42.625 --> 38:43.625
Butterfly.

38:43.895 --> 38:45.695
Okay. Then I'll embroider a butterfly.

38:49.825 --> 38:50.264
That's it.

38:50.265 --> 38:51.335
Cut. Finish.

38:52.185 --> 38:54.054
Master Xie,
I'm so grateful to you for this.

38:54.055 --> 38:54.704
Thank you so much.

38:54.705 --> 38:55.664
It's nothing.

38:55.665 --> 38:56.784
Let's take a picture together.

38:56.785 --> 38:57.264
Sure.

38:57.265 --> 38:58.784
Let me take a picture for you!

38:58.785 --> 38:59.305
Okay. Take a picture.

38:59.306 --> 39:00.894
Join us, Mr. Xie.

39:00.895 --> 39:02.425
No, I'm not along for the ride.

39:02.785 --> 39:04.065
Hurry up!

39:05.225 --> 39:06.255
Look at the camera.

39:06.895 --> 39:07.664
Let me adjust it a little bit.

39:07.665 --> 39:09.585
Okay. Three. Two. One.

39:10.305 --> 39:11.374
Done!

39:11.375 --> 39:11.705
Okay.

39:11.705 --> 39:12.375
Thanks a lot.

39:12.375 --> 39:12.895
Anytime.

39:12.896 --> 39:13.784
Take care.

39:13.785 --> 39:14.785
Okay.

39:15.225 --> 39:16.014
Director Liu.

39:16.015 --> 39:17.624
I'll send you the materials via email

39:17.625 --> 39:18.664
after I exported them tonight.

39:18.665 --> 39:19.015
No problem.

39:19.016 --> 39:20.255
I have something else to ask you.

39:23.415 --> 39:25.414
Director Liu,
does your TV station

39:25.415 --> 39:26.894
have a program for wood carving?

39:26.895 --> 39:28.184
I wanna recommend you

39:28.185 --> 39:29.574
a municipal inheritor
of intangible cultural heritage.

39:29.575 --> 39:31.304
He was given the title
even earlier than Master Xie.

39:31.305 --> 39:34.025
But he is particularly low profile,
a veteran craftsman.

39:34.575 --> 39:36.545
But we just went to Jianchuan last month.

39:38.895 --> 39:39.624
It's fine.

39:39.625 --> 39:40.264
We can talk about it later.

39:40.265 --> 39:41.374
There are definitely other opportunities
in the future.

39:41.375 --> 39:41.824
Sure.

39:41.825 --> 39:42.574
Talk to you later.

39:42.575 --> 39:43.585
No problem.

39:47.935 --> 39:48.305
Okay.

39:48.306 --> 39:49.374
I'll see myself out.

39:49.375 --> 39:50.704
Gezi. Please walk Director Liu out.

39:50.705 --> 39:51.304
Okay.

39:51.305 --> 39:52.015
See you.

39:52.015 --> 39:52.345
Let me take it for you.

39:52.346 --> 39:53.585
Take care.

40:09.225 --> 40:10.375
They all left?

40:11.495 --> 40:12.585
Auntie.

40:12.865 --> 40:13.934
You had an exhausting day.

40:13.935 --> 40:15.454
Go home early and get some rest.

40:15.455 --> 40:16.624
I'm not exhausted.

40:16.625 --> 40:18.175
I haven't done any physical work.

40:20.185 --> 40:22.425
While they were filming just now,
I was thinking

40:23.185 --> 40:25.664
if my mom hadn't given
up being an embroiderer

40:25.665 --> 40:26.945
and hadn't gone out to work,

40:27.495 --> 40:28.655
she would be

40:28.975 --> 40:30.945
recording the show
with you right now.

40:31.785 --> 40:33.744
If your mom didn't work,

40:33.745 --> 40:35.545
how could she pay for your education?

40:36.935 --> 40:38.864
I didn't have a child to raise.

40:38.865 --> 40:40.295
Otherwise, at that time
I also had to leave the village

40:40.575 --> 40:43.465
and go out to work with your
mom in order to make money.

40:45.705 --> 40:47.295
Do you miss your mom?

40:51.745 --> 40:52.894
You were still in junior high school

40:52.895 --> 40:54.735
when your mom passed away.

40:55.455 --> 40:57.905
It's been 20 years now.

40:58.535 --> 40:59.625
How time flies.

41:21.495 --> 41:22.495
Yao.

41:22.785 --> 41:24.215
Taste it.

41:26.665 --> 41:27.665
It's just right.

41:28.935 --> 41:30.374
Granny.

41:30.375 --> 41:31.414
Granny.

41:31.415 --> 41:33.545
I'm hungry.

41:33.865 --> 41:35.494
Give Xiaxia a call.

41:35.495 --> 41:37.144
Ask him if he is almost here.

41:37.145 --> 41:38.585
I've called him. He said he'll be here soon.

41:39.095 --> 41:40.744
Take a shower before you eat.

41:40.745 --> 41:41.455
You are smelly.

41:41.456 --> 41:42.855
You gross.

41:45.575 --> 41:47.695
I've washed my hands.

41:49.705 --> 41:51.264
Why did you kick me?

41:51.265 --> 41:52.335
Go to shower.

41:52.785 --> 41:54.335
Granny.

41:54.745 --> 41:56.304
You could scold him.

41:56.305 --> 41:58.224
But why did you beat him？

41:58.225 --> 41:58.895
Granny.

41:58.896 --> 42:00.744
You can't be so partial to him and spoil him.

42:00.745 --> 42:02.494
You didn't treat me like
this when I was younger.

42:02.495 --> 42:04.184
It's a different era now.

42:04.185 --> 42:05.304
No physical punishment.

42:05.305 --> 42:06.664
It's uncivilized.

42:06.665 --> 42:08.855
Yes. Uncivilized.

42:10.865 --> 42:13.704
You've had enough fun at home,

42:13.705 --> 42:15.855
it's time for you to go back
to school in Kunming.

42:16.265 --> 42:17.344
Did you hear what granny said?

42:17.345 --> 42:19.824
You should go back to
Kunming and go back to school.

42:19.825 --> 42:21.144
You've stayed at home for a month.

42:21.145 --> 42:21.865
If you don't go back to school,

42:21.866 --> 42:23.145
you won't be able to keep up.

42:25.415 --> 42:26.655
I don't want to go back.

42:27.745 --> 42:29.505
You must go to school.

42:30.305 --> 42:31.304
Granny.

42:31.305 --> 42:32.534
I don't want to go to school.

42:32.535 --> 42:33.344
I wanna stay here.

42:33.345 --> 42:34.375
I wanna raise a horse.

42:35.055 --> 42:35.784
Brother.

42:35.785 --> 42:36.784
You can venture out and have your own career.

42:36.785 --> 42:38.545
I'm gonna stay here and take care of granny.

42:39.185 --> 42:40.824
You still need someone
to serve you all three meals,

42:40.825 --> 42:42.374
and you don't even know how to wash dishes.

42:42.375 --> 42:43.574
You always run around the village

42:43.575 --> 42:44.864
like a wild dog all day long
and no one is able to find you.

42:44.865 --> 42:46.375
How can you take care of granny?

42:46.625 --> 42:48.824
That's because granny has you now,
so she doesn't need me.

42:48.825 --> 42:49.945
Right, granny?

42:51.265 --> 42:53.184
Why did you kick me again?

42:53.185 --> 42:54.255
Granny.

42:55.415 --> 42:57.454
Don't hit him!

42:57.455 --> 42:58.304
Granny.

42:58.305 --> 42:59.095
You won't let me hit him.

42:59.096 --> 43:00.255
But why did you hit me!

43:00.785 --> 43:01.934
I didn't hit you.

43:01.935 --> 43:04.264
I just patted you slightly.

43:04.265 --> 43:04.865
Right.

43:04.866 --> 43:06.704
Pat slightly.

43:06.705 --> 43:08.065
Sorry. My bad, brother.

43:08.785 --> 43:10.464
Go back to cook.

43:15.855 --> 43:21.325
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

43:23.295 --> 43:28.245
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

43:30.705 --> 43:36.755
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

43:37.075 --> 43:42.455
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

43:45.415 --> 43:50.805
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

43:52.785 --> 43:57.645
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

44:00.215 --> 44:06.415
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

44:06.745 --> 44:12.935
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

44:15.025 --> 44:21.464
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

44:21.465 --> 44:28.215
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

44:29.595 --> 44:31.644
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:31.645 --> 44:36.035
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

44:36.275 --> 44:43.505
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

44:48.285 --> 44:53.445
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

44:55.615 --> 45:00.975
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

45:03.005 --> 45:09.424
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

45:09.425 --> 45:16.315
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

45:17.785 --> 45:24.234
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

45:24.235 --> 45:31.185
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

45:32.445 --> 45:34.424
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

45:34.425 --> 45:39.024
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

45:39.025 --> 45:46.025
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

45:46.385 --> 45:53.345
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫
